      "part": "i",
      "title": "Add polynomials and find degree · (i)",
      "stem": "Add the following polynomials and find the degree of the resultant polynomial.",
      "sourceEnglish": "p(x) = 6x² − 7x + 2; q(x) = 6x³ − 7x + 15",
      "sourceMathLatex": "p(x)=6x^2-7x+2,\\quad q(x)=6x^3-7x+15",
      "answer": "6x³ + 6x² − 14x + 17; degree 3",
